<title>USA: GPU 610 MW N.J. nuke seen on line Thursday.</title>
<headline>GPU 610 MW N.J. nuke seen on line Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>GPU Nuclear's 610 megawatt Oyster Creek nuclear power plant in Forked River, N.J., is expected to begin electricity production Thursday after a repair outage, a company spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>&quot;It should be back on line about noon (EST),&quot; spokeswoman Sue Mysak said Thursday.</p>
<p>The plant was taken off line Oct 5 due to fluctuating levels of generator cooling water.</p>
<p>Oyster Creek began startup on Wednesday.</p>
<p>GPU Nuclear is a subsidiary of GPU Inc.</p>
<p>--New York Power Desk +1 212 859 1627</p>
</text>
